{
 "about": "Line cases both scanners must agree on. Each case's text is its parts joined. A part \"@seq:N\" expands at run time to N characters: for i in 0..N, ALPHABET[(i*7+3) % 62] with ALPHABET = 0-9, a-z, A-Z. Every value is fabricated; secret shapes are split across parts so no provider's push protection sees a key-shaped string in this file.",
 "alphabet": "0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ",
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "anthropic key",
   "layer": "org",
   "parts": [
    "key: sk-",
    "ant-api03-FIXTURE-not-a-real-key-0000"
   ],
   "expect": [
    "secret.anthropic"
   ]
  },
